                                        <div class="ugb-container__content-wrapper ugb-df3f64e-content-wrapper">
                                            <div>
                                            <p class="has-text-align-center" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Thank you for caring enough to help us keep our roadways free of litter! With your help, we can go a long way in keeping Tennessee clean and beautiful.</p>
                                            <p class="has-text-align-center" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">The litter hotline is available for concerned citizens like yourself to take action by letting us know when you witness littering from vehicles on the state’s roadways.</p>
                                            

                                            <div class="container center2 clearfix contentpara">
                                                
<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-e31b1b2" id="litter-hotline" data-block-id="e31b1b2"><h1 class="stk-block-heading__text has-text-color has-text-align-center">Litter Hotline</h1></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-button-group stk-block-button-group stk-block stk-a4daad3" data-block-id="a4daad3"><div class="stk-row stk-inner-blocks has-text-align-center stk-block-content stk-button-group">
<div class="wp-block-stackable-button stk-block-button stk-block stk-1973525" data-block-id="1973525"><a class="stk-link stk-button stk--hover-effect-darken" href="https://free.qrplanet.com/litterhotline" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="stk-button__inner-text">Save the Number</span></a></div>
</div></div>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-heading stk-block-heading stk-block-heading--v2 stk-block stk-c25ad8c" id="how-to-report-a-litterer-to-the-hotline" data-block-id="c25ad8c"><h2 class="stk-block-heading__text has-text-align-center">How to Report a Litterer to the Hotline</h2></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-47e9320" data-block-id="47e9320"><div class="stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-47e9320-column">
<div class="wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-ec78d8a" data-v="4" data-block-id="ec78d8a"><div class="stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-ec78d8a-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding"><div class="stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-ec78d8a-inner-blocks">
<div class="wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-26a30dd" data-block-id="26a30dd"><p class="stk-block-text__text has-text-align-center">Call the Litter Hotline: <br>1-877-8-LITTER <br>(<a href="tel:1-877-854-8837"><strong>1-877-854-8837</strong></a>)</p></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-f332400" data-block-id="f332400"><p class="stk-block-text__text has-text-align-center"><strong>OR</strong></p></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-6fd6aa0" data-block-id="6fd6aa0"><p class="stk-block-text__text has-text-align-center">Fill out the online Litter Hotline form:</p></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-button-group stk-block-button-group stk-block stk-e25c937" data-block-id="e25c937"><div class="stk-row stk-inner-blocks has-text-align-center stk-block-content stk-button-group">
<div class="wp-block-stackable-button stk-block-button stk-block stk-df6f694" id="report-litterers" data-block-id="df6f694"><a class="stk-link stk-button stk--hover-effect-darken" href="https://www.tn.gov/tdot/local-programs-community-investments/community-investments-office/highway-beautification-office/litter.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="stk-button__inner-text">Report Litterers</span></a></div>
</div></div>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-7f76e92" data-v="4" data-block-id="7f76e92"><div class="stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-7f76e92-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding"><div class="stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-7f76e92-inner-blocks"><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="alignright size-full is-resized"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="540" height="473" src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Iphone2.gif" alt="litter hotline" class="wp-image-4055" style="width:405px;height:355px"/></figure>
</div></div></div></div>
</div></div>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Helpful Tips on How to Use the Litter Hotline</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>To report a litterer, you must have the TN license plate number of the vehicle that was in violation.</li>
</ul>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The litterer does not receive a fine when you report them. Instead, they receive a friendly reminder letter that includes information about how to contain their litter and informs them that litterers <a href="/5-facts-you-should-know-about-littering-laws-in-tennessee/">can be fined up to $2,500</a> if they are caught by the State Patrol.</li>
</ul>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="700" height="700" src="https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-700x700.png" alt="" class="wp-image-7064" style="aspect-ratio:1.7777777777777777;object-fit:cover;width:480px;height:auto" srcset="https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-700x700.png 700w, https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-250x250.png 250w, https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-150x150.png 150w, https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-768x768.png 768w, https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2-120x120.png 120w, https://nobodytrashestennessee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/TDOT-ILLUST-STICKER-part-2_0022_License_Plate_2.png 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /></figure>
</div>


<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Some of the Most Commonly Thrown Trash</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Some of the litter culprits we often see are:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Cigarette Butts </li>



<li>Drink Bottles and Styrofoam Cups </li>



<li>Fast Food Packaging </li>



<li>Food Waste (apple cores, banana peels, etc.)</li>



<li>Diapers </li>



<li>Plastic Bags</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The above items, and many more types of litter, can lead to water pollution and air pollution. By reporting litterers at 1-877-8-LITTER (<a href="tel:1-877-854-8837">1-877-854-8837</a>) or by filling out the online <a href="https://www.tn.gov/tdot/local-programs-community-investments/community-investments-office/highway-beautification-office/litter.html">Litter Hotline Form</a>, we can do our part to help protect the environment and keep our state looking beautiful.</p>



<div style="height:25px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
</div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
